/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (0:00\2051:00\012\012Think about the last thing you shared, watched, or asked an AI tool. What made it useful? What made you hesitate? Online habits can help us connect and learn, while also affecting our attention, privacy, and the information other people receive. This project gives us a way to examine one specific habit and make a small change we can actually test. It works with an example or your own observation. Today we will use a fictional news post, then you will have time to think about a habit of your own. You do not need to share personal details.\012\012Presenter cue: Pause briefly after the opening questions. Keep this slide up for the first minute.\012\012) /QuadPoints [ 1234 12 1254 12 1234 32 1254 32 ] /Rect [ 1234 12 1254 32 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
