19 0 obj
<<
/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (5:00\2056:00\012\012Now I identify the risk: passing along a claim before I have evidence for it. That can mislead people making plans. The benefit is still worth keeping. I want to help friends find useful transport information. Naming both makes the change more realistic. I do not have to stop sharing news to improve how I share it. The form lets participants select a risk or describe their own, and it asks them to write the benefit they want to preserve.\012\012Presenter cue: Live: choose Next step. Point to the selected risk and benefit. Backup: read those two fields from this slide.\012\012) /QuadPoints [ 1234 12 1254 12 1234 32 1254 32 ] /Rect [ 1234 12 1254 32 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
