/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (6:00\2057:00\012\012The change is specific: find a dated transit-agency announcement before forwarding the claim. If I cannot verify it, I will say that clearly. The check is also specific: for the next three news posts I consider sharing, note whether I found an original source. I can review that in seven days. The summary stays editable. I can download a text copy or print it. Answers remain temporary unless I enable Save on this device. Saving uses this browser only, so a shared device needs care. Clear reflection removes the draft and the current answers.\012\012Presenter cue: Live: choose Next step, point to change/check/date, then Build my action plan. Briefly show Edit my answers, Download text, Print action plan, and the unchecked saving control. Backup: show the completed summary screenshot. Avoid opening personal drafts.\012\012) /QuadPoints [ 1234 12 1254 12 1234 32 1254 32 ] /Rect [ 1234 12 1254 32 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
