/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (9:00\2059:25\012\012The development work made three decisions concrete. Source cards need clear limitations. Private reflection needs an explicit choice about saving. And accessibility includes what happens when someone goes back, reloads a draft, or cannot use browser storage. Those decisions shape whether a participant can complete the activity.\012\012Presenter cue: Describe the demonstrated design decisions. Add personal experiences only if Mina has confirmed them.\012\012) /QuadPoints [ 1234 12 1254 12 1234 32 1254 32 ] /Rect [ 1234 12 1254 32 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
