/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (9:25\20510:00\012\012The takeaway is a repeatable process: observe a habit, evaluate the evidence, identify a risk and a benefit, then act. Keep the benefit you value, try one change, and review what actually happened. The worksheet has the same four steps. The activity is part of Signal & Self, using the submitted website link. Thank you.\012\012Presenter cue: Show the worksheet and website address. End by 10:00. The existing public link will gain the activity after the reviewed change is published.\012\012) /QuadPoints [ 1234 12 1254 12 1234 32 1254 32 ] /Rect [ 1234 12 1254 32 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
